{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"molarity-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"ca","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"molarity-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["molarity-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"ca","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"La molaritat és la quantitat de solut en mols dividida pel volum total de la solució en litres. Per exemple, ZXQPH0000QXZ mol en ZXQPH0001QXZ L de solució és ZXQPH0002QXZ mol/ L (ZXQPH0003QXZ M). Useu el volum final de la solució, no el volum de solvent abans d' afegir el solut.","record_id":"308b81349e4e81254cb2374ffc01d63108718f3654fc299bf619bb1aa6759908","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":2.519622681499982,"source":"Molarity is the amount of solute in moles divided by the total solution volume in liters. For example, 1 mol in 2 L of solution is 0.5 mol/L (0.5 M). Use the final solution volume, not the volume of solvent before adding solute.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"7cb141aae44ff8a92ab6d76162ce5a2b4c9d18e59d5d12c5186327e785046520","status":"machine-draft","translation":"La molaritat és la quantitat de solut en mols dividida pel volum total de la solució en litres. Per exemple, 1 mol en 2 L de solució és 0.5 mol/ L (0.5 M). Useu el volum final de la solució, no el volum de solvent abans d' afegir el solut.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
